{"term": {"label": "信", "occurrences": 5, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "二", "id": "二"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "弗", "id": "弗"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "斯", "id": "斯"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "舜", "id": "舜"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6863989535702288, "source": "誠", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.791759469228055, "source": "信", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "信", "target": "弗"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "弗", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 1.9315214116032138, "source": "弗", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "弗", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.1138429683971682, "source": "弗", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 1.08422355121601, "source": "弗", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.7773707317759555, "source": "弗", "target": "二"}, {"weight": 2.1138429683971682, "source": "弗", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.6438393391514328, "source": "弗", "target": "斯"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "悅", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.18283583988412, "source": "悅", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 0.5877866649021191, "source": "悅", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.529358412358834, "source": "先", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "先", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.6936614636501104, "source": "斯", "target": "二"}, {"weight": 2.7424516278195425, "source": "斯", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "舜", "target": "治"}, {"weig